/* home — 首页（§41.6.3）：视觉重点 问候/问题 → 输入框 → 个性化故事；首屏无功能宫格 */
.page {
  min-height: 100vh;
  padding: 24rpx 32rpx calc(48rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.greeting {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  margin-top: 32rpx;
}
.greeting-text { margin-top: 24rpx; text-align: center; }

.input-area { margin-top: 48rpx; }

.trending { margin-top: 36rpx; }
.trending-label { display: block; margin-bottom: 16rpx; }
.trending-scroll { width: 100%; }
.trending-track {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: row;
  gap: 16rpx;
  width: max-content;
  padding-right: 32rpx;
}

.foryou { margin-top: 56rpx; }

.section-head {
  display: flex;
  align-items: baseline;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-bottom: 24rpx;
}
.section-title { font-size: 38rpx; }
.section-link { padding: 8rpx; }

.empty {
  padding: 48rpx 32rpx;
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  background: rgba(255, 249, 246, 0.6);
  border: 1rpx dashed var(--color-line);
}
.empty-text { text-align: center; }

.affirmation-area { margin-top: 64rpx; }

.affirmation-ai {
  display: block;
  margin-bottom: 16rpx;
  font-size: 20rpx;
}

.swipe-hint {
  display: block;
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: 20rpx;
}

.running-note {
  display: block;
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: 48rpx;
}
